# Scoutbook policy

Follow [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) and [docs/process/general-policy.md](mdc:docs/process/general-policy.md).

Hard rules:
- Docs (scouting/RFC) before new feature code; stay inside charter MVP unless a new RFC exists.
- Shared contracts in `@scoutbook/types`; UI via `@scoutbook/ui` (shadcn).
- Never commit secrets; never return `passwordHash`; auth per RFC 0001.
- Prefer `graphify query` / `path` / `explain` when `graphify-out/graph.json` exists.
- After structural code changes: `graphify update .`
- Commit only when the user asks.
